# PlatformIO build output, downloaded platforms/libs, and IDE metadata.
.pio/

# Build-time secrets, merged in via `extra_configs` (issue #76). The wildcard in
# platformio.ini means an absent file is fine — the build then compiles without
# credentials and the node never attempts an update. Deliberately NOT named
# `.env*`: that namespace is a blanket permission deny fleet-wide (DEC-S043), so
# a secret living there is one no session can read to debug.
*secret*.ini

# Per-build firmware archive (fw_build_id.py). One .bin per build, sortable by
# the build id; clean it up by hand whenever.
build_archive/
